0..75 Comment "//! A rule of an operation that states no symmetry fires in one order only."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..155 Comment "//! A rule fires in the two orders of its arguments where its theory states"
156..231 Comment "//! that the operation is commutative. A theory that does not state the law"
232..309 Comment "//! gives no such right. A match that tries the two orders for each operation"
310..334 Comment "//! admits a false path."
335..338 Comment "//!"
339..415 Comment "//! The theory of a series has one rule and no symmetry. The checker matches"
416..494 Comment "//! the rule in the written order, so it refuses the path for the other order."
495..498 Comment "//!"
499..515 Comment "//! - see: #8299"
